{"a":[31,32],"h":"<p>31.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"94\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 94.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 31.6 39.0 54.8 54.8 63.8 71.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"31.6 39.0 63.8 71.3 78.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ya görmedi mi de onlar - o istihza edip duran kullar? <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"239\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 239.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.7 42.7 49.6 49.6 57.0 72.7 83.3 83.3 99.0 99.0 108.0 108.0 116.3 123.0 123.0 129.7 145.6 152.3 159.0 159.0 171.0 177.7 177.7 186.7 202.6 202.6 211.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"72.7 116.3 129.7 152.3 171.0 186.7 211.6 222.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> kendilerinden evvel ne kadar karınlar helâk etmişiz:<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 192.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 54.0 54.0 61.6 77.3 89.3 98.3 98.3 107.3 107.3 115.6 115.6 122.3 129.8 129.8 145.6 145.6 154.6 154.6 162.8 162.8 169.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 61.6 81.8 122.3 162.8 169.6 176.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onlar, onlara dönüp gelmiyorlar - ya'ni Dünyaya bir daha dönmiyorlar 32.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"89\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 89.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 27.0 27.0 47.3 47.3 57.7 57.7 64.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"64.4 72.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve hepsi - o ihlâk edilen ve henüz edilmiyen hepsi başka değil<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"217\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 216.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.8 57.0 57.0 69.8 69.8 85.6 92.3 99.0 99.0 105.8 114.8 131.3 131.3 140.3 147.0 147.0 156.0 177.0 183.8 183.8 192.8\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 42.8 92.3 105.8 114.8 156.0 183.8 192.8 200.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> yalnız toplanıp bizim huzurumuza ıhzar edilmekte olan bir cem'ıyyet bulunuyorlar - böyle iken nasıl olur da başka ilâhlar ittihaz edip şirk koşarlar?</p><p>IHZAR, huzura getirmek demektir. Mahkemeye rızasıyle gelmiyen kimseyi tutup cebren hâkimin huzuruna getirmek ma'nâsında kullanılır ki burada bilhassa bu ma'nâyadır. Ya'ni herkes ölmekle yok olup gitmiyor, hisab ve ceza için Hak tealânın huzuruna haşr-ü sevk olunuyor.</p><p>Bu tebliğden sonra bir de aklî delillerle tenvir olunarak buyuruluyor ki: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"445\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 445.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.8 9.8 9.8 16.6 37.6 44.3 52.6 52.6 59.3 59.3 75.0 81.8 88.6 88.6 100.6 108.0 120.0 126.8 144.0 150.8 159.8 166.6 173.3 173.3 180.0 186.8 186.8 198.8 214.6 214.6 214.6 221.3 228.0 228.0 234.8 243.8 243.8 251.3 267.0 285.8 285.8 294.0 298.6 306.0 321.8 321.8 330.8 330.8 339.0 355.6 355.6 362.3 369.0 369.0 375.8 393.0 406.6 417.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 44.3 81.8 100.6 108.0 120.0 126.8 150.8 166.6 180.0 198.8 221.3 234.8 267.0 294.0 339.0 362.3 375.8 429.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p>"}